==============================================================================

── A1. brief: a fully qualifying invoice, net 10,000 + VAT 1,500 ─
  [PASS] collecting 11,500 on net 10,000 gives a base of 10,000

── A2. brief: a partial collection of 5,750 on that same invoice ─
  [PASS] collecting 5,750 gives a qualifying base of 5,000

── A3. non-qualifying lines come out too ─────────────────────────
  [PASS] 10,000 net less 2,000 non-qualifying is 8,000

── A4. a base can never go negative ──────────────────────────────
  [PASS] an over-subtracted base floors at zero, it does not claw back

