── B2. a zero base earns nothing, and does not throw ─────────────
  [PASS] zero base, zero commission

==============================================================================
  C — TIERS APPLY TO THE SLICE, NOT TO THE WHOLE BASE
==============================================================================

── C1. brief: a cumulative base of 110,000 earns 1,150 ───────────
