==============================================================================

── E1. brief: 5,000 then the remaining 5,000 adds 50, it does not re-add 100 
  [PASS] the first 5,000 earns 50.00
  [PASS] cumulative 10,000 is worth 100.00
  [PASS] so the second payment adds 50.00, not another 100.00

── E2. a re-delivered payment adds nothing ───────────────────────
