==============================================================================

── G1. a Riyadh month begins at 21:00 UTC on the last day of the previous month 
  [PASS] February 2026 starts at 2026-01-31T21:00:00Z
  [PASS] and ends at 2026-02-28T21:00:00Z

── G2. the month edge falls on the Riyadh boundary, not the UTC one 
  [PASS] 22:00 UTC on 31 Jan belongs to February
  [PASS] 20:00 UTC on 31 Jan still belongs to January

── G3. December rolls into the next year ─────────────────────────
  [PASS] December 2026 ends at 2026-12-31T21:00:00Z

==============================================================================
  H — PLAN VERSIONS AND ASSIGNMENT OVERLAP
==============================================================================

── H1. the version in force is chosen by the date the money arrived 
  [PASS] a March collection uses v1
  [PASS] a September collection uses v2
